Dundun dance is the tricky art of drumming and dancing at the same time. This was great group organised by one of our Palmwoods drummers, Katie. Katie first saw this type of drum and dance online and asked us if we could run a workshop. She gathered a massive group and we went up to Chatsworth and had a whole lot of fun. We danced the rhythm Sunu with a few funky breaks created by us. We had so much fun that we have decided to run a 4 week Dundun Dance course up that way.

If you interested contact us or book for your sessions [here](/product/4-class-pass-drum-dance-classes/). The dates for sessions are May 22nd, May 29th, June 5th, June 12th. Cost is $80 for the 4 weeks. Drums and sticks are provided.Please mention "Gympie Dundun Dance" on booking your course. Bookings essential by May 10th. Check out our video!

You can also check out one of our [favourite dundun dance](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2kLsszGF_X0)s online with the amazing Yansane Kouyate!
